ok: no interrupted operation; the ledger and the manifests agree; 2 hypr trees have an entry file; 1 profile tree matches its recorded manifest; rescue.sh restores generation 0000 and parses; attic: 2 entries, 0 B (the newest, rescue-0000, 0 B); no verify-config copies; no interrupted gc
